# NeuraBar tests

- Any test that touches `Persistence` **must** inherit from `NBTestCase` — it
  redirects `Persistence.overrideDir` to a temp dir so the real data store is
  never mutated.
- New `Loc` keys must be added to `LocalizationTests`'s `allCases` list and have
  an English translation (`testEveryLocKeyHasEnglishTranslation` guards this).
- macOS-API calls needing a real `.app` bundle must stay guarded with
  `Bundle.main.bundlePath.hasSuffix(".app")` — the xctest runner crashes otherwise.
- Run the suite with full Xcode:
  `DEVELOPER_DIR=/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer swift test`.

Full inventory: [docs/TESTING.md](mdc:docs/TESTING.md).
